     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: 概念映射 Appendix10-to-HazardType</b></p><a name=\"Appendix10-to-HazardType\"> </a><a name=\"hcAppendix10-to-HazardType\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"ValueSet-VS-Appendix10-Operation.html\">附表十特別危害健康作業值集（35 項）</a> to <a href=\"ValueSet-VS-HazardType.html\">特別危害健康作業類別值集</a></p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-CS-Appendix10Operation.html\">附表十特別危害健康作業具名代碼系統</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-CS-HazardType.html\">特別危害健康作業類別代碼系統</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>app-01 (高溫作業)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>high-temp (高溫作業)</td><td>具名作業為該危害家族之特定成員，家族涵蓋範圍較廣（narrower：source 較 target 窄）。</td></tr><tr><td>app-02 (噪音作業)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>noise (噪音作業)</td><td>具名作業為該危害家族之特定成員，家族涵蓋範圍較廣（narrower：source 較 target 窄）。</td></tr><tr><td>app-03 (游離輻射作業)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>radiation (游離輻射作業)</td><td>具名作業為該危害家族之特定成員，家族涵蓋範圍較廣（narrower：source 較 target 窄）。</td></tr><tr><td>app-04 (異常氣壓作業)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>abnormal-pressure (異常氣壓作業)</td><td>具名作業為該危害家族之特定成員，家族涵蓋範圍較廣（narrower：source 較 target 窄）。</td></tr><tr><td>app-05 (鉛作業)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>lead (鉛作業)</td><td>具名作業為該危害家族之特定成員，家族涵蓋範圍較廣（narrower：source 較 target 窄）。</td></tr><tr><td>app-06 (四烷基鉛作業)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map